Nimbus logo

Source: https://github.com/nimbusdotstorage/Nimbus/blob/715b269bc355efe5107f3169ca5f8788e6a56078/apps/web/src/components/icons/logo-icon.tsx
License: Apache-2.0, reproduced in the accompanying LICENSE file.

Modifications: retained the original three artwork paths, set explicit icon
sizes, added theme-aware foreground colors, and adapted SVG accessibility and
React props for this application. No artwork paths were changed.

The README icon scales the original artwork onto a squircle using the app’s
default dark background and grain texture.

The installable app icons (app/apple-icon.png and public/icons/*.png) place
the original artwork paths, in white and scaled down, on a square or rounded
square filled with the app's default primary color.
